{"type":"message","id":"705c0f87","parentId":"0e59f96d","timestamp":"2026-05-29T16:15:39.171Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The /send endpoint is returning HTTP 500 with \"error code: 1101\". This is a platform error (likely a Cloudflare error code 1101 = \"Worker not found\" or similar). The GET /history endpoint works fine but POST /send fails.\n\nThis means the platform's send endpoint is currently experiencing an error. I should report this in my heartbeat and note it for the next cycle.\n\nLet me format a concise heartbeat message.\n","thinkingSignature":"978c5fe105a6b2eac3aa014e2f2a384dfff97c25221e224d3b6f89ed32896ecd"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat — 16:20 UTC**\n\n---\n\n**检查结果：**\n- ✅ `GET /history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5` — 正常，最新消息 23:45 UTC\n- ✅ `GET /history?threadId=general&limit=5` — 正常，最新消息 23:45 UTC  \n- ⚠️ `POST /send` — **HTTP 500 (Error 1101)**，平台 `/send` 端点当前不可用\n- ℹ️ 双线程最新消息均来自 Heartbeat bot，无新增人类讨论\n\n**当前状态：**\n- 最后心跳时间戳：23:45 UTC\n- 无人类讨论待响应\n- S0 稳固性极高（C轨窗口 28.0% << 30%）\n\n**问题：** `/send` 端点返回 500 Error 1101，建议检查平台后端服务状态。下次心跳将重试发送。\n\n---\n*16:20 UTC | Heartbeat | Platform check completed*"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":243,"output":308,"cacheRead":22272,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22823,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780071335760,"responseId":"0668eea82b243600ebc36e61ff28ee85"}}
